    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d233">

                <pb facs="0277" n="265" sameAs="frus:frus1940v01/pg265"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 European War 1930/384: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Germany</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Heath</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-06-22T23:00:00+02:00">June 22, 1940—11
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received June 23—1:47 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2036. At approximately 10:30 tonight the German radio broadcast a special
                    bulletin announcing the signature at 6:50 this evening in the forest of
                    Compiegne of a Franco-German armistice agreement.<anchor n="16" xml:id="d233-f1"
                    /> At the same time it was stated that French plenipotentiaries would proceed to
                    a meeting with Italian plenipotentiaries and that the Franco-German armistice
                    agreement would not enter into effect until 6 hours after the signature of an
                    Italian-French armistice agreement. After <pb facs="0278" n="266" xml:id="pg266"
                    /> the singing of national anthems the announcement concluded with the
                    declaration that now the struggle goes forward against England.</p>
                <p>The bulletin contained no information concerning the terms of the Franco-German
                    armistice agreement.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Heath</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
